# OpenShift Container Platform 4.22.16 — Production Installation & Configuration Guide
## Bare Metal · Disconnected (Air-Gapped) · Agent-Based Installer

> **Target release: OpenShift Container Platform 4.22.16** (4.22 is an Extended Update Support release). All tooling — `oc`, `openshift-install`, `oc-mirror`, `butane` — must be downloaded for **4.22.16**, and operator catalogs use the `v4.22` index tag. Confirm 4.22.16 is still a supported z-stream on the Red Hat OpenShift lifecycle page at install time; if a newer 4.22.z is current, substitute it consistently throughout.
